# Version 1.4.3 - Combined YesMenn config bridge

## Added

- Added a config screen bridge that opens the combined YesMenn Colored Lights config screen when YesMenn is installed.
- VILC's existing config hotkey now keeps the same keybind while routing to the combined screen when available.

## Changed

- VILC still opens its standalone light-rendering config screen when YesMenn is not installed.

