# Version 1.4.2 - Spotlight beam shaping support

## Added

- Added a public area-light shape registry for mods that need per-light beam softness and focus controls.
- Added shader uniforms for per-area-light beam edge softness and focus.

## Changed

- Area-light cone falloff now uses per-light softness instead of one hard-coded edge width.
- Area-light focus can now tighten or soften the cone core independently from brightness.

