# Version 1.3.3 - Local-light shadow fill and shaderpack lighting balance

## Improved

- Added a bounded screen-blended fill pass for strong nearby Veil lights
- Local colored lights now soften existing sunlight and moonlight shadows
- Dark shaderpack pixels receive more fill than already bright surfaces

