# Version 1.3.2 - Full area-light surface support

## Added

- Area-light width, height, and orientation are now transferred into the Iris light pass
- Area lighting now originates from the nearest point on the emitting surface

## Changed

- Area-light distance attenuation, surface response, and voxel shadows now use the actual rectangular emitter
- Rectangular and tube-shaped Veil lights retain their spatial extent with shaderpacks enabled

## Fixed

- Fixed 180-degree area lights producing a dark directional seam

