# Version 1.3.0 - Independent quality controls and expanded debug compatibility

## Added

- Configurable point-light budget from 1 to 96 lights
- Configurable area-light budget from 1 to 32 lights
- Independent toggles for detailed surface normals and voxel shadows
- Custom quality state for settings that differ from a preset
- BetterF3 compatibility for VILC diagnostics

## Changed

- Quality presets now apply complete defaults instead of locking individual settings
- Performance defaults to 24 point lights and 8 area lights
- Balanced defaults to 48 point lights and 16 area lights
- High defaults to 96 point lights and 32 area lights
- Reworked the configuration screen into separate performance and appearance controls
- F3 diagnostics now show the active configured light budgets

